Project: Off-Grid Solar Micro-Grid Energy Billing & Battery Health Monitor

Student: Uhoranayezu Tertullien (ID: 29776)

1. Entities Identified (5+ Relational Tables)

CUSTOMERS — Anonymised micro-grid customer accounts and service zones.

METERS — Smart meters assigned to customers and linked to a micro-grid battery bank.

BATTERY_BANKS — Micro-grid battery bank units and rated specifications.

CONSUMPTION_LOGS — Meter energy usage readings ($kWh$) and billing/tariff records per reading interval.

BATTERY_HEALTH_LOGS — Periodic battery telemetry readings (voltage, current, temperature, State of Charge, State of Health).

MAINTENANCE_ALERTS — Operational/maintenance alerts triggered by low credit/disconnection or battery health thresholds.

(Note: If modeling multi-operator or multi-technician assignments across battery banks, a junction table such as MAINTENANCE_ASSIGNMENTS resolves the many-to-many relationship between maintenance alerts/tasks and technicians.)

